<title>POLAND: Elektrim Q2 net falls to PLN 8.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Elektrim Q2 net falls to PLN 8.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elektrim SA preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating loss			 0.31   vs    4.27 profit</p>
